-- chi co 4 Tasker/nganh o TPHCM, xen giua nhieu tinh thanh khac). Ca 50 Tasker o day deu
-- verification_status = VERIFIED (ho so ky nang) VA kyc_status = VERIFIED (danh tinh) - dung
-- de dam bao khi test "Tasker goi y" cho 1 cong viec o TPHCM, danh sach hien du gan 10 nguoi
